### cronApi 冒烟脚本（VS Code REST Client / GoLand HTTP Client 可直接执行）
@host = http://127.0.0.1:8080

### 1. 健康检查
GET {{host}}/healthz

### 2. 小程序登录（mock 模式：openid:xxx 直接指定用户）
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/wechat/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "openid:u1001"
}

### 3. 当前用户（需替换 access_token）
GET {{host}}/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.access_token}}

### 4. 刷新 token
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refresh_token": "{{login.response.body.data.refresh_token}}"
}

### 5. 创建联调任务（对自身健康检查接口做一次断言）
POST {{host}}/api/v1/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "示例-健康检查",
  "description": "每 5 分钟检查一次服务健康",
  "base_url": "{{host}}",
  "cron_expr": "*/5 * * * *",
  "enabled": false,
  "max_retry": 1,
  "timeout_sec": 30,
  "steps": [
    {
      "name": "healthz",
      "method": "GET",
      "url": "/healthz",
      "auth": "none",
      "asserts": [
        {"source": "status", "op": "eq", "value": "200"},
        {"source": "json:status", "op": "eq", "value": "ok"}
      ]
    }
  ]
}

### 6. 立即执行任务
POST {{host}}/api/v1/tasks/1/run
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.access_token}}

### 7. 查看执行记录
GET {{host}}/api/v1/tasks/1/runs
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.access_token}}
